WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.690
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:46.960 --> 01:51.800
[Episode 15]

3
01:58.240 --> 01:59.520
[Shen Mo]

4
02:03.200 --> 02:05.120
Come on, Shen Mo.

5
02:05.120 --> 02:07.679
Say hello to your dear Mr. Ji.

6
02:11.800 --> 02:13.320
Mr. Ji.

7
02:13.320 --> 02:16.920
We'll fight together.

8
02:16.920 --> 02:18.660
Behave yourself.

9
02:19.320 --> 02:20.720
Ji Ming Xuan.

10
02:20.720 --> 02:23.120
If you want your dear Shen Mo to be safe...

11
02:23.120 --> 02:25.400
First, stop interfering with my family's projects immediately.

12
02:25.400 --> 02:27.800
Second, return all the assets and funds

13
02:27.800 --> 02:30.000
you've owed our family all these years.

14
02:30.000 --> 02:33.560
And you must compensate us for emotional distress.

15
02:33.560 --> 02:34.960
Do you hear me?

16
02:34.960 --> 02:36.960
Fine, I agree.

17
02:36.960 --> 02:38.120
I'll give them to you.

18
02:38.120 --> 02:39.480
As long as you let Shen Mo go,

19
02:39.480 --> 02:41.060
I'll give you everything.

20
02:41.840 --> 02:43.040
You'd better.

21
02:43.040 --> 02:45.100
Time is running out.

22
02:47.720 --> 02:49.800
Now, we'll just have to wait for Ji Ming Xuan to show his sincerity.

23
02:49.800 --> 02:52.040
We're not afraid even if he calls the police.

24
02:52.040 --> 02:53.560
I've already found a scapegoat.

25
02:53.560 --> 02:57.960
Besides, everyone in the city knows Ji Ming Xuan hates the Zhou family.

26
02:57.960 --> 03:01.000
We'll just say he's deliberately slandering us.

27
03:01.000 --> 03:05.119
Anyway, we have connections too, don't we?

28
03:08.439 --> 03:09.999
So, should we keep him alive?

29
03:15.200 --> 03:17.140
If it weren't for you,

30
03:18.000 --> 03:21.360
the Zhou family wouldn't be in this state.

31
03:21.360 --> 03:23.440
You're the culprit.

32
03:23.440 --> 03:26.220
Don't you think you deserve to die?

33
03:29.800 --> 03:32.520
You're the real culprit.

34
03:32.520 --> 03:35.240
Your own son disowned you.

35
03:35.240 --> 03:36.840
How does it feel to be working

36
03:36.840 --> 03:38.400
with an illegitimate son?

37
03:38.400 --> 03:41.320
Do you really have a death wish?

38
03:41.320 --> 03:43.680
Once Ji Ming Xuan's money arrives,

39
03:43.680 --> 03:45.820
find someone to finish him off.

40
03:47.599 --> 03:50.439
You just want money, right?

41
03:50.439 --> 03:52.080
I'll give it to you.

42
03:52.080 --> 03:53.560
I'll give it all to you!

43
03:53.560 --> 03:54.561
Mr. Ji, please calm down.

44
03:54.561 --> 03:56.080
How can I be calm?

45
03:56.080 --> 03:58.100
Shen Mo is in their hands!

46
03:58.760 --> 04:00.120
The assets and money they want...

47
04:00.120 --> 04:02.600
We can't process all that in such a short time.

48
04:02.600 --> 04:03.880
I don't care.

49
04:03.880 --> 04:05.040
Find a way!

50
04:05.040 --> 04:07.240
Transfer everything that can be moved.

51
04:07.240 --> 04:08.720
I just need them to let Shen Mo go.

52
04:08.720 --> 04:10.400
If we agree to their demands,

53
04:10.400 --> 04:12.240
Mr. Shen will lose his leverage.

54
04:12.240 --> 04:15.200
This will put Mr. Shen in even more danger.

55
04:32.760 --> 04:35.020
The people sent to find Shen Mo...

56
04:35.959 --> 04:37.279
Any news from them?

57
04:37.279 --> 04:38.759
I've already sent them out.

58
04:38.759 --> 04:40.319
They just found his car.

59
04:40.319 --> 04:43.400
But they can't locate him yet.

60
04:51.400 --> 04:53.041
Wait. Locate...

61
04:53.041 --> 04:56.080
I downloaded an app for our phones.

62
04:56.080 --> 04:57.520
What app?

63
04:57.520 --> 04:59.279
A location tracking app.

64
04:59.279 --> 05:01.959
This way, I can see you wherever you are.

65
05:01.959 --> 05:04.800
And of course, you can see me, too.

66
05:04.800 --> 05:06.120
What?

67
05:06.120 --> 05:08.079
Are you that afraid I'll run away?

68
05:11.160 --> 05:13.580
I'm afraid you won't be able to find me.

69
05:22.040 --> 05:24.920
Did he foresee this day coming?

70
05:27.279 --> 05:29.800
I know where Shen Mo is.

71
05:29.800 --> 05:31.920
- Call the police. - Got it.

72
05:37.800 --> 05:40.360
If I don't deal with the Zhous for good,

73
05:40.360 --> 05:43.519
how can I be with you in peace?

74
05:43.519 --> 05:46.319
I won't let anyone hurt you.

75
05:46.319 --> 05:48.520
Even if it's just a possibility.

76
05:53.519 --> 05:55.439
Watch your surroundings next time.

77
05:57.200 --> 05:59.520
When my hand heals and I can paint again,

78
05:59.520 --> 06:01.680
I'll find a job as an artist.

79
06:01.680 --> 06:03.860
I'll support you then.

80
06:06.600 --> 06:10.960
When I become a great painter and start making money,

81
06:10.960 --> 06:13.580
I'll buy you that big house over there.

82
06:16.840 --> 06:21.519
No matter what happens, I'll be by your side.

83
06:21.519 --> 06:23.559
It's good that you're back.

84
06:25.839 --> 06:28.199
I won't let anyone hurt you.

85
06:30.520 --> 06:32.220
No one.

86
06:48.960 --> 06:51.360
Once Ji Ming Xuan's shares are transferred,

87
06:51.360 --> 06:55.560
we can take back everything we lost.

88
06:55.560 --> 06:57.360
Don't speak too soon.

89
06:57.360 --> 06:59.800
They haven't been transferred yet.

90
06:59.800 --> 07:03.500
Besides, don't get so close to me.

91
07:04.680 --> 07:07.199
Look how anxious Ji Ming Xuan is.

92
07:07.199 --> 07:09.160
He's as good as in our hands.

93
07:09.160 --> 07:11.639
It looks like a car is coming.

94
07:11.639 --> 07:13.439
A car?

95
07:13.439 --> 07:15.319
It couldn't be the police, could it?

96
07:15.319 --> 07:17.120
Why would the police be here?

97
07:17.120 --> 07:20.040
And how could they be so fast?

98
07:20.040 --> 07:21.160
The police are here!

99
07:21.160 --> 07:22.940
What?

100
07:24.279 --> 07:25.879
You idiot!

101
07:29.880 --> 07:31.920
Is this your doing?

102
07:31.920 --> 07:33.480
Even if I die, I'm taking you with me!

103
07:33.480 --> 07:34.639
Bro!

104
07:34.639 --> 07:36.839
If we run now, we can still pull some strings later.

105
07:36.839 --> 07:38.279
If we kill him, it'll be a huge deal.

106
07:38.279 --> 07:40.999
- It'll be hard to manage. - You coward!

107
07:45.879 --> 07:48.280
None of you are reliable!

108
08:02.480 --> 08:03.481
You'll come.

109
08:03.481 --> 08:05.040
I know you'll come.

110
08:05.040 --> 08:07.860
You'll come. I know you'll come.

111
08:08.880 --> 08:10.540
You'll come.

112
08:17.280 --> 08:18.281
Don't come any closer!

113
08:18.281 --> 08:19.880
I have Shen Mo!

114
08:19.880 --> 08:22.320
Zhou Chu, let Shen Mo go,

115
08:22.320 --> 08:24.660
and I'll consider letting you live.

116
08:25.360 --> 08:27.239
You're finally here.

117
08:29.840 --> 08:31.480
Don't come any closer!

118
08:31.480 --> 08:32.720
You'd better think carefully.

119
08:32.720 --> 08:34.839
Would you rather fall into the hands of the police...

120
08:35.720 --> 08:37.980
or into mine?

121
08:44.160 --> 08:45.900
No need to chase them.

122
08:46.759 --> 08:48.719
They won't get away.

123
08:50.720 --> 08:52.520
I knew...

124
08:54.080 --> 08:55.599
you would come.

125
09:22.720 --> 09:24.380
Stop pretending.

126
09:30.039 --> 09:32.200
Just lie down and behave.

127
09:32.200 --> 09:33.360
I'm really fine now.

128
09:33.360 --> 09:36.040
The doctor said it's just minor injuries.

129
09:45.280 --> 09:46.860
Fine.

130
09:48.400 --> 09:50.500
But you still need to lie down.

131
09:51.840 --> 09:52.960
All right, all right.

132
09:52.960 --> 09:55.279
You went too far this time.

133
09:55.279 --> 09:56.639
If something had really happened to you,

134
09:56.639 --> 09:58.479
how should I even cope?

135
09:59.160 --> 10:01.120
Hey, calm down.

136
10:01.120 --> 10:02.320
I promise.

137
10:02.320 --> 10:05.080
I won't take matters into my own hands like that again.

138
10:05.080 --> 10:07.120
I really don't know what you were thinking.

139
10:07.120 --> 10:08.679
The best way to solve a problem...

140
10:08.679 --> 10:11.360
is to get rid of the people causing it.

141
10:11.360 --> 10:14.360
I told you I wanted to fight by your side.

142
10:14.360 --> 10:18.640
So... what about Mrs. Zhou and Zhou Chu?

143
10:18.640 --> 10:19.720
Oh.

144
10:19.720 --> 10:21.000
They've been arrested.

145
10:21.000 --> 10:24.120
They should be sentenced soon.

146
10:24.120 --> 10:27.320
No matter how Mrs. Zhou pulls strings,

147
10:27.320 --> 10:29.520
they won't be able to escape this time.

148
10:29.520 --> 10:33.240
See? At least it's a happy ending, right?

149
10:40.399 --> 10:42.000
Come on.

150
10:46.920 --> 10:49.960
You knew Mrs. Zhou would use you to threaten me.

151
10:49.960 --> 10:51.520
You had it all planned out.

152
10:51.520 --> 10:53.920
That's why you had me install that tracking app, right?

153
10:53.920 --> 10:55.360
Not exactly.

154
10:55.360 --> 10:56.720
I had you install that app...

155
10:56.720 --> 11:00.180
purely because I wanted to keep tabs on your every move.

156
11:03.200 --> 11:05.680
But back to the point,

157
11:05.680 --> 11:08.320
I didn't think they'd actually do it.

158
11:08.320 --> 11:10.360
Then again, it's not my first kidnapping.

159
11:10.360 --> 11:12.160
I'm already quite experienced.

160
11:12.160 --> 11:15.320
But I didn't expect Mrs. Zhou...

161
11:15.320 --> 11:17.000
to show up herself.

162
11:17.800 --> 11:21.160
So, I recorded all the evidence of their crimes.

163
11:21.160 --> 11:22.840
Mrs. Zhou is very cunning.

164
11:22.840 --> 11:25.080
If it were just my word against hers,

165
11:25.080 --> 11:27.680
she'd use her influence to manipulate things.

166
11:27.680 --> 11:29.800
But with this recording as hard evidence,

167
11:29.800 --> 11:33.180
there's nothing they can do.

168
11:33.960 --> 11:37.280
Weren't you afraid they'd lose their minds and hurt you?

169
11:38.360 --> 11:40.640
The Zhous are all incredibly selfish.

170
11:40.640 --> 11:42.279
Self-preservation is their top priority.

171
11:42.279 --> 11:43.320
Look at them.

172
11:43.320 --> 11:46.280
As soon as the police arrived, they all tried to run.

173
11:47.000 --> 11:50.920
Besides... I knew you would come to save me.

174
11:50.920 --> 11:52.920
Oh, you.

175
11:52.920 --> 11:54.560
I can't believe you'd gamble like that.

176
11:54.560 --> 11:57.400
As long as you're here, I'm willing to risk anything.

177
12:01.000 --> 12:02.480
Be quiet.

178
12:02.480 --> 12:04.519
So...

179
12:04.519 --> 12:05.600
does this mean we can finally...

180
12:05.600 --> 12:07.920
be together without any worries?

181
12:10.200 --> 12:11.800
Of course.

182
12:20.000 --> 12:21.159
See? I told you.

183
12:21.159 --> 12:22.279
It's just minor injuries.

184
12:22.279 --> 12:24.360
I'll be discharged soon.

185
12:24.360 --> 12:26.479
You should still be careful.

186
12:28.679 --> 12:31.040
I heard he used to be a star.

187
12:31.040 --> 12:34.480
Yeah. It's sad he ended up like this because of his sponsor.

188
12:34.480 --> 12:36.200
What's there to pity?

189
12:36.200 --> 12:37.960
He did plenty of bad things before.

190
12:37.960 --> 12:39.420
Oh?

191
12:40.720 --> 12:43.600
That guy looks familiar.

192
12:43.600 --> 12:45.800
Was that Zhao Yi?

193
12:45.800 --> 12:48.260
He just got what he deserved.

194
12:58.160 --> 12:59.740
Boss.

195
13:01.040 --> 13:02.200
Boss.

196
13:02.200 --> 13:04.600
When is your partner coming back?

197
13:04.600 --> 13:07.120
Didn't he say he'd be back today?

198
13:07.120 --> 13:09.320
I kind of miss him.

199
13:09.320 --> 13:11.160
And I've decided...

200
13:11.160 --> 13:14.440
I'll call the boss lady, "Mr. Ji,"

201
13:14.440 --> 13:17.199
and I'll call you, "Mrs. Ji."

202
13:18.520 --> 13:19.920
You ungrateful thing.

203
13:19.920 --> 13:22.400
Does he pay your salary, or do I?

204
13:22.400 --> 13:24.039
Isn't it the same thing?

205
13:24.039 --> 13:26.679
You two are together anyway.

206
13:27.840 --> 13:29.519
Oh, I have to go.

207
13:29.519 --> 13:31.120
What's up?

208
13:33.440 --> 13:35.600
"Mrs. Ji" is going to pick up "Mr. Ji."

209
13:35.600 --> 13:36.601
Really?

210
13:36.601 --> 13:38.120
Then hurry up and go!

211
13:38.120 --> 13:39.121
Don't worry.

212
13:39.121 --> 13:41.840
I'll handle everything in the studio.

213
13:41.840 --> 13:43.000
You don't come here often anyway.

214
13:43.000 --> 13:44.320
- Okay. - Go on.

215
13:44.320 --> 13:46.180
- I'm off. - Okay.

216
13:58.840 --> 14:00.040
You're finally back.

217
14:00.040 --> 14:02.120
Xiao Ning's been asking for his dad daily.

218
14:02.120 --> 14:04.560
Isn't he still with you, his other dad?

219
14:04.560 --> 14:05.919
I can see it now.

220
14:05.919 --> 14:09.080
You're ready to be a hands-off parent.

221
14:09.080 --> 14:10.080
Let's go home.

222
14:10.080 --> 14:11.081
It's been a long day.

223
14:11.081 --> 14:12.280
I'm exhausted.

224
14:12.280 --> 14:13.600
I want to rest for a bit.

225
14:13.600 --> 14:16.520
Then do you want to go to my place?

226
14:16.520 --> 14:19.080
I don't think I've ever been to your house.

227
14:19.080 --> 14:20.280
Where is it?

228
14:20.280 --> 14:22.660
Let's go. You'll see when we get there.

229
14:29.040 --> 14:31.620
I didn't get to look around properly when I came back last time.

230
14:32.920 --> 14:35.100
I feel like things have changed so much.

231
14:35.760 --> 14:38.060
It's fine as long as the people haven't changed.

232
14:40.280 --> 14:41.281
Shen Mo.

233
14:41.281 --> 14:42.440
Yeah?

234
14:42.440 --> 14:43.840
Where are you driving to?

235
14:43.840 --> 14:46.480
Why does this feel so familiar?

236
14:46.480 --> 14:48.440
Just close your eyes and sleep.

237
14:48.440 --> 14:50.660
You'll know when we get there.

238
14:52.680 --> 14:54.260
Okay.

239
14:54.920 --> 14:56.860
You and your little tricks.

240
14:59.879 --> 15:01.639
Drive carefully.

241
15:01.639 --> 15:02.681
Watch the road.

242
15:02.681 --> 15:04.079
Don't look at me.

243
15:05.520 --> 15:07.100
Okay.

244
15:26.440 --> 15:28.040
Mr. Ji.

245
15:28.040 --> 15:29.920
Welcome home.

246
15:29.920 --> 15:31.840
Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

247
15:31.840 --> 15:34.040
Why did you bring me here?

248
15:34.040 --> 15:36.440
Have you forgotten, Mr. Ji?

249
15:36.440 --> 15:37.681
Even though you told Lawyer Chen

250
15:37.681 --> 15:40.200
to take back Jinxiu Mountain Villa,

251
15:40.200 --> 15:42.679
I didn't agree to it at the time.

252
15:43.240 --> 15:44.600
[Jinxiu Mountain Villa]

253
15:44.600 --> 15:47.140
So, I still have the key.

254
15:48.840 --> 15:51.040
You still have the key?

255
15:54.880 --> 15:57.580
Isn't this a gift from you, Mr. Ji?

256
15:58.840 --> 16:00.120
Yes.

257
16:00.120 --> 16:01.719
It's for you.

258
16:12.200 --> 16:14.559
Have you been living here since then?

259
16:14.559 --> 16:16.080
Yes.

260
16:16.080 --> 16:17.280
Hey.

261
16:20.600 --> 16:22.260
Are you okay?

262
16:23.120 --> 16:24.719
I'm fine.

263
16:29.000 --> 16:31.060
Actually, seven years ago...

264
16:32.360 --> 16:35.000
I went to the Zhou Group once.

265
16:35.000 --> 16:37.720
I ended up taking a fall there

266
16:37.720 --> 16:40.120
and was taken to the hospital.

267
16:40.120 --> 16:43.640
Although it wasn't anything serious, but I...

268
16:43.640 --> 16:45.240
I completely lost my memory

269
16:45.240 --> 16:47.260
of what happened during those six months.

270
16:48.760 --> 16:51.220
That's why...

271
16:53.000 --> 16:55.000
If that hadn't happened,

272
16:55.000 --> 16:57.679
I definitely would've found you sooner.

273
16:59.600 --> 17:00.900
Does it hurt?

274
17:01.520 --> 17:02.980
What?

275
17:03.720 --> 17:06.800
Didn't you fall down the stairs back then?

276
17:09.799 --> 17:11.960
Did it hurt?

277
17:11.960 --> 17:13.360
When I was delirious,

278
17:13.360 --> 17:15.119
I mistook this man for Zhou Yang.

279
17:15.119 --> 17:18.519
And then I completely forgot about him after I woke up.

280
17:18.519 --> 17:20.599
I hurt him so much back then.

281
17:20.599 --> 17:21.880
Yet all he cares about...

282
17:21.880 --> 17:23.919
is whether I was in pain.

283
17:24.600 --> 17:26.220
Mr. Ji.

284
17:29.040 --> 17:30.920
It seems it really did hurt.

285
17:30.920 --> 17:33.000
You're almost in tears.

286
17:37.000 --> 17:38.440
Mr. Ji.

287
17:38.440 --> 17:40.359
Since you didn't know I lost my memory,

288
17:40.359 --> 17:41.800
did you think all these years...

289
17:42.480 --> 17:44.500
that I was intentionally avoiding you?

290
17:48.839 --> 17:50.800
I was just a stranger to you.

291
17:53.480 --> 17:55.220
During those years,

292
17:55.960 --> 17:59.160
did you come to Jinxiu Mountain Villa often?

293
17:59.160 --> 18:00.860
Occasionally.

294
18:01.560 --> 18:03.920
Did you come alone?

295
18:03.920 --> 18:05.799
Yes.

296
18:05.799 --> 18:07.280
Why?

297
18:10.400 --> 18:11.960
I'm not telling you.

298
18:11.960 --> 18:14.240
Oh, come on, just tell me.

299
18:14.240 --> 18:16.200
Why did you come here alone?

300
18:16.200 --> 18:18.260
Can you tell me?

301
18:28.240 --> 18:30.119
I missed you.

302
18:41.800 --> 18:43.520
Let's go.

303
18:43.520 --> 18:45.020
I'll carry you.

304
18:58.880 --> 19:03.060
When you're old, I'll still carry you like this.

305
19:04.240 --> 19:06.720
You'll definitely get old before me.

306
19:06.720 --> 19:09.540
Who knows who will be carrying whom then?

307
19:10.799 --> 19:13.240
Well, I'm the one carrying you now.

308
19:13.240 --> 19:15.200
We'll see about the future.

309
19:17.720 --> 19:20.280
The furniture here is all child-proof.

310
19:20.280 --> 19:21.760
No fresh paint was used.

311
19:21.760 --> 19:24.060
Xiao Ning can move in right away.

312
19:29.279 --> 19:30.879
Come with me.

313
19:59.080 --> 20:00.700
How are the paintings?

314
20:01.680 --> 20:03.840
Not bad, right?

315
20:03.840 --> 20:06.240
One month was a bit too short.

316
20:06.240 --> 20:10.040
And I used my right hand, so it's not that detailed.

317
20:12.519 --> 20:14.119
It's fine.

318
20:19.880 --> 20:21.500
Shen Mo.

319
20:34.039 --> 20:36.200
What is the meaning of this?

320
20:50.720 --> 20:52.340
It's a proposal.

321
21:00.200 --> 21:02.940
You're the only one I want to spend the rest of my life with.

322
21:04.280 --> 21:05.920
Ji Ming Xuan...

323
21:05.920 --> 21:07.760
I want to spend...

324
21:07.760 --> 21:09.860
the rest of my life with you.

325
21:10.560 --> 21:12.480
For richer or for poorer.

326
21:12.480 --> 21:15.519
In sickness and in health.

327
21:15.519 --> 21:17.400
To love and to honor,

328
21:17.400 --> 21:19.119
to cherish and protect,

329
21:20.520 --> 21:23.480
until death do us part.

330
21:23.480 --> 21:26.360
Ji Ming Xuan has done so much for me.

331
21:26.360 --> 21:29.160
It's my turn to take the initiative.

332
21:29.160 --> 21:32.600
I've always wondered why Ji Ming Xuan fell for me.

333
21:32.600 --> 21:34.800
But since he did,

334
21:34.800 --> 21:37.560
I must strive to be a better person

335
21:37.560 --> 21:40.880
to be worthy of his love.

336
21:40.880 --> 21:43.599
I'll work hard to support our family.

337
21:45.079 --> 21:47.240
Mr. Ji, does this mean...

338
22:09.920 --> 22:12.100
This is my answer.

339
23:13.120 --> 23:14.200
Hey, Xiao Ning.

340
23:14.200 --> 23:15.440
Daddy still has work to do.

341
23:15.440 --> 23:17.080
Why don't you play with Mr. Shen first?

342
23:17.080 --> 23:19.060
Okay.

343
23:22.800 --> 23:24.360
This is how a dinosaur roars.

344
23:24.360 --> 23:26.200
Roar like a dinosaur with me.

345
23:26.200 --> 23:29.720
- Let's go woof, woof, woof! - Woof, woof, woof!

346
23:29.720 --> 23:30.920
Isn't Daddy mean?

347
23:30.920 --> 23:32.900
He won't even play with us.

348
23:47.319 --> 23:49.599
Why are you being so serious?

349
23:51.200 --> 23:53.640
Let me see the photo.

350
23:53.640 --> 23:55.840
Daddy. You can go now.

351
23:55.840 --> 23:58.320
We're going to keep playing.

352
23:58.320 --> 24:01.320
- It looks good. - Mr. Ji, get back to work.

353
24:01.320 --> 24:04.519
Wow, you're just tossing me aside now?

354
24:04.519 --> 24:06.599
Let's get married.

355
24:12.600 --> 24:14.360
- Daddy Shen. - Yes?

356
24:14.360 --> 24:16.880
Can you get me a toy?

357
24:16.880 --> 24:19.840
It's in the bedroom drawer.

358
24:19.840 --> 24:21.200
Okay.

359
24:21.200 --> 24:22.400
Have fun.

360
24:22.400 --> 24:24.740
Be good. I'll go get it for you.

361
24:46.320 --> 24:49.040
So, you prepared a ring, too.

362
24:49.040 --> 24:51.580
I just beat you to it.

363
25:11.760 --> 25:13.400
Xiao Ning, you're such a good boy.

364
25:13.400 --> 25:14.680
Come here.

365
25:18.400 --> 25:22.180
He often says I was the one who pursued him first.

366
25:23.080 --> 25:24.920
And that's true.

367
25:24.920 --> 25:30.079
So, let Mr. Ji's little secret remain a secret forever.

368
25:42.240 --> 25:43.480
Where on earth are you taking me?

369
25:43.480 --> 25:44.640
You're being so mysterious.

370
25:44.640 --> 25:46.720
Can I open my eyes yet?

371
25:47.800 --> 25:49.500
You'll find out in a moment.

372
25:52.320 --> 25:53.940
We're here.

373
25:56.080 --> 25:57.460
Okay.

374
26:04.240 --> 26:05.700
Open your eyes.

375
26:09.960 --> 26:11.660
Happy birthday.

376
26:13.039 --> 26:16.240
I missed your birthday seven years ago.

377
26:16.240 --> 26:19.120
From now on,

378
26:19.120 --> 26:21.460
I don't want to miss it ever again.

379
26:32.079 --> 26:33.559
Okay.

380
26:35.039 --> 26:37.839
Let's not miss a single day of our lives together.

381
26:40.720 --> 26:42.100
Okay.

382
28:07.120 --> 28:09.700
I like you.

383
29:04.240 --> 29:05.820
I love you...

384
29:06.440 --> 29:08.260
My dear Mr. Ji.

385
29:22.840 --> 29:24.040
Daddy!

386
29:24.040 --> 29:25.780
- Yes? - Yes?
